	"id": "lmrs-shop",
	"name": "LMRS Shop",
	"repo": "theetherGit/lmrs-shop",
	"url": "https://github.com/theetherGit/lmrs-shop",
	"summary": "A SvelteKit app on Cloudflare D1 (Drizzle) for a small snack shop to manage, analyse and predict its daily sales and production.",
	"description": "The shop's database schema (serving menu, stock log, one revenue row per day, forecasts, learned factor weights and the login tables), then the form handlers that record stock and the analyzers that reconcile production against UPI and cash takings.",
	"notes": "Only five real foreign keys exist (factorWeight, weightAuditLog x2, session, account); inventory, operatingRevenue, forecast, holiday and datesheet relate only by date strings, so they are drawn unconnected. There are no customer or order tables: sales are one aggregate operatingRevenue row per day. No code yet writes operatingRevenue, forecast, factorWeight or weightAuditLog, and RatioWastageAnalyzer is not imported anywhere, so prediction exists only as schema. scripts/* are standalone experiments with their own Serving interface (adds name). stockTypes is the zod const name; the other inline column enums (dayOfWeek, holiday type, shift, subject) have no code name and are shown as string.",
